flowchart LR
	U[User Input\nOwner + Pet + Tasks] --> UI[Interface\nStreamlit or CLI]
	UI --> R[Retriever\nCategory Guidance Lookup]
	UI --> P[Agent Planner\nScheduler + Guardrails]
	R --> P
	P --> O[Output\nDaily Plan + Explanation]

	P --> E[Evaluator\nReliability Report + Planning Log]
	E --> T[Tester\nPytest Reliability Checks]

	O --> H[Human Review\nOwner checks plan quality]
	H --> F[Feedback\nEdit tasks/preferences]
	F --> UI

